{"id": "70489", "title": "我有病，得治", "author": "韩脉脉", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 31, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70489/70489s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70489.htm", "intro": "作为西大第一挂科王，姜教授表示这么勇敢的学生已经不多了。此刻讲台上正躺着一张无辜的假条\r\n    ——老师：\r\n    我有病，得治。\r\n    南安安\r\n    南安安绝对不会写这样一张请假条来挑衅姜铭，\r\n    如果她知道姜铭会成为她的导师、男神以及……男人。\r\n    当伪女神真逗比遇到伪傲娇真男神~\r\n    PS： 1V1，双处，HE\r\n    本文又名《逗比，去哪儿》 《一日为夫，悔不当初》", "base": "files/article/html/70/70489", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔子", "file": "10982333.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982338.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982341.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982352.html", "available": true}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982353.html", "available": true}, {"title": "我有病，得治", "file": "10982354.html", "available": true}, {"title": "23-26", "f